      "updated": 1788535263254,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Messanger tell General1 and General 2 we are ready to attack on city.\n\n\nThere are lot of problems that can occur in between \n\nWhat if Messager is caught by some guard of the city\nwhat if G2 has got message g1 is prepared but G1 was not able to, then G2 only will attack",
